## DarkestHour: Имперский Рейд

dh-imperial-commander-name = Imperial Squad Commander
dh-imperial-commander-objective = Lead the Imperial Marine Corps raid. Make the station surrender or take it by storm.
dh-imperial-weapons-name = Imperial Weapons Specialist
dh-imperial-weapons-objective = Bring the heavy firepower of the raid: a drum shotgun, a rifle or an incinerator — your choice.
dh-imperial-medic-name = Imperial Field Medic
dh-imperial-medic-objective = Keep the raid alive. Light armour plates, an SMG or a rifle, and a built-in weapon in your armour.
dh-imperial-machinegunner-name = Imperial Machinegunner
dh-imperial-machinegunner-objective = Pin the defenders down: a light machine gun in light plates, or the IHMG-17 in heavy plates.
dh-imperial-rifleman-name = Imperial Rifleman
dh-imperial-rifleman-objective = The backbone of the raid. Follow your commander's orders.

dh-name-format-imperial-commander = Commander {$part0}
dh-name-format-imperial-weapons = Specialist {$part0}
dh-name-format-imperial-medic = Medic {$part0}
dh-name-format-imperial-machinegunner = Gunner {$part0}
dh-name-format-imperial-rifleman = Marine {$part0}

dh-imperial-kit-window-title = Imperial requisition
dh-imperial-kit-window-description = Choose your loadout. The case turns into the chosen gear: weapon, ammunition and an IMB-1 modular armour suit with its special system.

dh-imperial-set-weapons-assault-name = Assault: IMSH-17 drum shotgun
dh-imperial-set-weapons-assault-description = Automatic 14-gauge shotgun with four drums (shot, slug, flechette). IMB-1 with a composite torso; special system: auto-medic.
dh-imperial-set-weapons-rifle-name = Rifle: IR-17
dh-imperial-set-weapons-rifle-description = IR-17 battle rifle with five magazines (ImpS, ImpR, ImpZ). IMB-1 with a composite torso; special system: extra storage.
dh-imperial-set-weapons-flamer-name = Incinerator: IFL-17
dh-imperial-set-weapons-flamer-description = Long-range IFL-17 incinerator with napalm tanks. IMB-1 with a composite torso; special system: a fuel tank rack.
dh-imperial-set-medic-smg-name = SMG: IMG-17L
dh-imperial-set-medic-smg-description = IMG-17L submachine gun with five magazines. Light IMB-1 plates; special system: built-in incinerator.
dh-imperial-set-medic-rifle-name = Rifle: IR-17
dh-imperial-set-medic-rifle-description = IR-17 battle rifle with four magazines. Light IMB-1 plates; special system: built-in pump shotgun (with a box of shells).
dh-imperial-set-machinegunner-light-name = Light machine gun: IMG-17T
dh-imperial-set-machinegunner-light-description = IMG-17T drum-fed machine gun with three drums. Light IMB-1 plates; special system: auto-medic.
dh-imperial-set-machinegunner-heavy-name = Heavy machine gun: IHMG-17
dh-imperial-set-machinegunner-heavy-description = IHMG-17 mounted heavy machine gun with four belts. Heavy IMB-1 plates; special system: auto-medic.
dh-imperial-set-rifleman-rifle-name = Rifle: IR-17
dh-imperial-set-rifleman-rifle-description = IR-17 battle rifle with five magazines. IMB-1 with a composite torso; special system: auto-medic.
dh-imperial-set-rifleman-smg-name = SMG: IMG-17L
dh-imperial-set-rifleman-smg-description = IMG-17L submachine gun with six magazines. IMB-1 with a composite torso; special system: auto-medic.
dh-imperial-set-rifleman-shotgun-name = Shotgun: IMPSH-17P
dh-imperial-set-rifleman-shotgun-description = IMPSH-17P pump shotgun with three boxes of shells. IMB-1 with a composite torso; special system: extra storage.

dh-imperial-sender = Imperial Marine Corps
dh-imperial-ultimatum = Attention, {$station}! This is the Imperial Marine Corps. Your station is surrounded. You have {$minutes} minutes to surrender. To surrender, raise the station to a high orbit — {$altitude} km or higher — and lay down your arms. If you refuse, we take the station by storm. Glory to the First Empire!
dh-imperial-surrender-accepted = Your surrender is accepted. Lay down your arms and await the boarding party. The crew will be evacuated. Glory to the First Empire!
dh-imperial-assault = Time is up. The station has not surrendered. The assault begins. Glory to the First Empire!
